    "lines": [
      {
        "id": "scene-1-1",
        "chapterId": "chapter-1",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "옛날 어느 마을에 놀부와 흥부라는 형제가 살았다.\n\n형 놀부는 꼼꼼했고, 동생 흥부는 마음이 따뜻했다.\n\n둘은 성격이 달랐지만 어릴 때에는 제법 사이가 좋은 형제였다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-1-2",
        "chapterId": "chapter-1",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "어느 날, 장에서 돌아오던 형제는 길가에 쭈그리고 앉은 아이 둘을 발견했다.\n\n흥부가 아이들에게 다가갔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-1-3",
        "chapterId": "chapter-1",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“왜 여기 있어?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-05",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-05",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.street-boy"
            },
            {
              "key": "R2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-06",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.street-girl"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-1-4",
        "chapterId": "chapter-1",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "아이",
        "text": "“배가 고파서…….”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-05",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-05",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.street-boy"
            },
            {
              "key": "R2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-06",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.street-girl"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-1-5",
        "chapterId": "chapter-1",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 손에 들고 있던 떡을 잠시 바라보았다.\n\n그러고는 떡을 반으로 나누어 아이들에게 하나씩 건넸다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-05",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-05",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.street-boy"
            },
            {
              "key": "R2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-06",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.street-girl"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-1-6",
        "chapterId": "chapter-1",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“너 먹을 건?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-1-7",
        "chapterId": "chapter-1",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“나는 집에 가서 먹으면 되지.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-1-8",
        "chapterId": "chapter-1",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부는 한숨을 쉬더니 자기 떡을 반으로 갈라 흥부에게 내밀었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-1-9",
        "chapterId": "chapter-1",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“형도 줬네?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-1-10",
        "chapterId": "chapter-1",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“나는 반만 줬잖아.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-1-11",
        "chapterId": "chapter-1",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“주는 건 똑같지.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-1-12",
        "chapterId": "chapter-1",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“그러니까 네가 답답한 거야.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-1-13",
        "chapterId": "chapter-1",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "둘은 티격태격하며 집으로 돌아갔다.\n\n그때만 해도 두 사람의 차이는 웃으며 넘길 수 있는 것이었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-young"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-young"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-2-1",
        "chapterId": "chapter-2",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "세월이 흘러 두 형제는 부모와 함께 농사를 지었다.\n\n흥부도 부지런히 일했지만 어려운 사람을 보면 좀처럼 그냥 지나치지 못했다.\n\n놀부는 아버지를 도와 장부와 곡식을 관리했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-2-2",
        "chapterId": "chapter-2",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흉년이 든 어느 날이었다.\n\n흥부가 곳간에서 곡식 한 자루를 꺼내다가 놀부에게 들켰다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-2-3",
        "chapterId": "chapter-2",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“그거 어디 가져가?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-2-4",
        "chapterId": "chapter-2",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“김 서방네. 며칠째 죽만 먹고 산대.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-2-5",
        "chapterId": "chapter-2",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“그건 내년에 심을 씨앗이야.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-2-6",
        "chapterId": "chapter-2",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“그래도 우리한테는 아직 있잖아.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-2-7",
        "chapterId": "chapter-2",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“그 ‘우리’에는 나도 있어.”\n\n“오늘 다 나눠 주면 내년에는 우리가 누구한테 얻으러 가야 하는데?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-2-8",
        "chapterId": "chapter-2",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“눈앞에서 굶는 사람을 그냥 보고 있으라고?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-2-9",
        "chapterId": "chapter-2",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "아버지",
        "text": "“둘 다 그만해라.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-2-10",
        "chapterId": "chapter-2",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "아버지",
        "text": "“흥부야. 남을 돕는 마음은 귀하다.”\n\n“하지만 가족이 함께 모은 것을 네 마음만으로 정해서는 안 된다.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-2-11",
        "chapterId": "chapter-2",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "아버지",
        "text": "“놀부야. 너도 곳간을 지키는 것만 생각해서는 안 된다.”\n\n“곡식을 모으는 까닭도 결국 사람이 먹고살기 위해서다.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-2-12",
        "chapterId": "chapter-2",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "어머니",
        "text": "“둘을 반씩 섞어 놓으면 딱 좋을 텐데.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-2-13",
        "chapterId": "chapter-2",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부와 놀부는 서로를 바라보았다.\n\n둘 다 자신의 생각이 조금 더 옳다고 믿었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-3-1",
        "chapterId": "chapter-3",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "세월이 더 흘러 두 형제는 차례로 혼인을 했다.\n\n흥부에게 첫아이가 태어나자 놀부는 작은 이불을 하나 들고 찾아왔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        },
        "presentation": {
          "transition": {
            "durationMs": 450,
            "mode": "auto",
            "type": "fade-black"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-3-2",
        "chapterId": "chapter-3",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“형이 이런 것도 사 와?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-3-3",
        "chapterId": "chapter-3",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“내가 무슨 돈만 세는 귀신인 줄 아냐?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-3-4",
        "chapterId": "chapter-3",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "두 형제는 함께 웃었다.\n\n하지만 흥부의 생활 방식은 결혼한 뒤에도 크게 달라지지 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-3-5",
        "chapterId": "chapter-3",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "흥부 아내",
        "text": "“당신이 어려운 사람을 돕는 건 좋아요.”\n\n“그런데 이제 당신이 쓰는 것이 당신 것만은 아니잖아요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-3-6",
        "chapterId": "chapter-3",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "흥부 아내",
        "text": "“돕지 말자는 게 아니에요.”\n\n“다음부터는 우리도 같이 의논했으면 좋겠어요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-3-7",
        "chapterId": "chapter-3",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "얼마 뒤 부모가 차례로 세상을 떠났다.\n\n형제에게는 집과 논밭, 농기구와 곡식, 그리고 약간의 빚이 남았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-3-8",
        "chapterId": "chapter-3",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“형, 이제 살림을 나누는 게 좋을 것 같아.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-3-9",
        "chapterId": "chapter-3",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“나도 그렇게 생각한다.”\n\n“하지만 내가 몇 년 동안 집안 살림과 부모님 일을 더 많이 맡았던 몫도 생각해야 해.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-3-10",
        "chapterId": "chapter-3",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“형이 많이 한 건 알아.”\n\n“그래도 부모님이 남긴 것이 형 것만은 아니잖아.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-3-11",
        "chapterId": "chapter-3",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "처음에는 재산을 어떻게 나눌지 이야기했을 뿐이었다.\n\n그러나 오래된 감정이 하나둘 끼어들었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-3-12",
        "chapterId": "chapter-3",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“넌 늘 마음 가는 대로 했지.”\n\n“그다음 일을 누가 정리했는지는 생각해 본 적 있어?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-3-13",
        "chapterId": "chapter-3",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“형은 왜 내가 한 일을 전부 철없는 짓처럼 말해?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-3-14",
        "chapterId": "chapter-3",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“철없는 짓이라고 한 게 아니야!”\n\n“뒷일도 생각하라는 거야!”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-3-15",
        "chapterId": "chapter-3",
        "order": 15,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "결국 형제는 각자의 살림을 꾸리기로 했다.\n\n흥부가 빈손으로 쫓겨난 것은 아니었다.\n\n작은 집과 밭, 농기구와 얼마간의 곡식을 가지고 가족과 함께 집을 나섰다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-3-16",
        "chapterId": "chapter-3",
        "order": 16,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그러나 두 형제의 마음에는 모두 조금씩 억울함이 남았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-1",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "처음 몇 해는 그럭저럭 살아갈 만했다.\n\n흥부는 부지런히 일했고 아이들도 하나둘 늘어났다.\n\n작은 집은 언제나 북적였다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        },
        "presentation": {
          "transition": {
            "durationMs": 450,
            "mode": "auto",
            "type": "fade-black"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-2",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "아이 1",
        "text": "“아버지! 제 밥이 형 것보다 적어요!”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "R2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R2"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-3",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "아이 2",
        "text": "“네 그릇이 작은 거야!”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "R2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-4",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“싸우지 마라. 아버지 것 조금씩 줄게.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "R2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-5",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "흥부 아내",
        "text": "“그러다 당신 밥이 없어져요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-6",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "가족은 웃었다.\n\n넉넉하지는 않았지만 행복한 날도 많았다.\n\n그러나 좋은 해만 이어지지는 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-7",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "큰비가 농사를 망친 해가 있었고, 아이가 아파 모아 둔 돈을 쓴 적도 있었다.\n\n흥부가 형편보다 조금 더 많이 남을 도운 일도 몇 번 겹쳤다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-8",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "흥부 아내",
        "text": "“최 서방네 도운 건 나도 찬성이었어요.”\n\n“하지만 이번 겨울 우리 아이들 먹을 쌀까지 당신 혼자 정해서 줄 일은 아니었어요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-9",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그해 겨울을 앞두고 쌀독의 바닥이 보이기 시작했다.\n\n어느 저녁 막내가 물었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "R2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-10",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "막내",
        "text": "“아버지, 내일은 밥 많이 먹어도 돼요?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "R2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R2"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-11",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 바로 대답하지 못했다.\n\n그날 밤 아내가 조심스럽게 말했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "R2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-12",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "흥부 아내",
        "text": "“놀부 형님께 가 보는 건 어때요?”\n\n“아이들까지 우리 자존심을 지켜야 하는 건 아니잖아요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-13",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "다음 날 흥부는 놀부를 찾아갔다.\n\n놀부는 생각보다 쉽게 고개를 끄덕였다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-mansion",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-14",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“겨울을 날 곡식은 빌려주마.”\n\n“봄부터 내 밭일을 돕고, 형편이 나아지면 천천히 갚아.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-mansion",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-15",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 15,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“그리고 내가 빌려주는 곡식만큼은 남에게 나누지 마.”\n\n“네 식구가 먹으라고 빌려주는 거니까.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-mansion",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-16",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 16,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“그것까지 형이 정해야 해?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-mansion",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-17",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 17,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“네가 따로 번 것까지 간섭하겠다는 게 아니야.”\n\n“하지만 빌린 것까지 나눠 버리면 나는 다시 못 빌려줘.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-mansion",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-18",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 18,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 반박하려다 입을 다물었다.\n\n놀부의 말이 완전히 틀린 것은 아니었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-mansion",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-19",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 19,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“……이번에도 내가 네 뒤를 치우는 것 같아서 그렇다.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-mansion",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-20",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 20,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그 말은 아팠다.\n\n흥부는 그 자리에서 대답하지 않았다.\n\n집으로 돌아와 가족에게 놀부의 조건을 모두 이야기했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-21",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 21,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "흥부 아내",
        "text": "“어느 쪽이든 쉽지는 않겠네요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-22",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 22,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부 가족은 오래 의논했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-4-23",
        "chapterId": "chapter-4",
        "order": 23,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부 가족은 어떤 길을 선택해야 할까?",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "1차 핵심 선택. 어느 쪽도 정답처럼 보이지 않게 동일한 무게로 제시.",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        },
        "flow": {
          "type": "choice",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "choice-winter-borrow",
              "label": "조건을 받아들이고 곡식을 빌린다",
              "targetLineId": "scene-5a-1"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-winter-other-way",
              "label": "곡식은 빌리지 않고 다른 방법을 찾는다",
              "targetLineId": "scene-5b-1"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-1",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부 가족은 놀부의 곡식을 빌리기로 했다.\n\n곡식 자루가 들어오자 아이들의 얼굴이 밝아졌다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-room",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "R2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-2",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "막내",
        "text": "“이제 밥 많이 먹어도 돼요?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-room",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "R2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R2"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-3",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“한꺼번에는 안 돼.”\n\n“이번에는 얼마나 먹을지 우리 다 같이 계산할 거야.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-room",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "R2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-4",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부 부부는 처음으로 겨울 동안 필요한 곡식을 꼼꼼히 나누어 보았다.\n\n흥부에게는 답답한 일이었지만, 남은 양을 알고 있다는 사실이 마음을 편하게 하기도 했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-room",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-5",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "봄이 되자 흥부는 약속대로 놀부의 밭에서 일했다.\n\n놀부는 언제 씨를 뿌리고, 어느 고랑으로 물을 빼야 하는지 꼼꼼하게 알고 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-6",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“형은 이런 걸 어떻게 다 기억해?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-7",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“누군가는 기억해야 했으니까.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-8",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 잠시 아무 말도 하지 않았다.\n\n어린 시절 자신이 곳간을 나설 때마다 남은 곡식을 세던 형이 떠올랐다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-9",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "어느 날 흥부는 자기 점심 절반을 배고픈 노인에게 건넸다.\n\n그 모습을 본 놀부가 인상을 찌푸렸다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-10",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“아직 빚도 다 안 갚았는데 또 그러냐?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-11",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“형에게 빌린 곡식은 안 건드렸어.”\n\n“우리 식구 먹을 것도 남겨 뒀고.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-12",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“그래도 계산은 하고 살아.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-13",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“그건 해 볼게.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-14",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "하지만 놀부의 조언은 점점 많아졌다.\n\n닭을 언제 팔지, 아이 옷을 언제 살지까지 말하기 시작했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-15",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 15,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“형이 도와준 건 정말 고마워.”\n\n“들을 말은 들을게.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-16",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 16,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“그런데 우리 집 일은 우리도 정해 볼게.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-17",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 17,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부는 못마땅한 얼굴을 했다.\n\n그러나 더는 말하지 않았다.\n\n초봄 동안 흥부는 약속대로 놀부의 밭에서 일했고, 빌린 곡식도 조금씩 갚아 나갔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-18",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 18,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 그 겨울을 지나며 두 가지를 함께 기억하게 되었다.\n\n도움이 있었기에 가족이 무사히 겨울을 넘긴 것과, 도움을 받는다고 해서 자기 삶의 모든 결정을 넘겨주어야 하는 것은 아니라는 것이었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5a-19",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5a",
        "order": 19,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "형제는 여전히 달랐다.\n\n하지만 이번에는 다르다는 이유만으로 등을 돌리지는 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "A 갈래 종료 후 공통 제비 장면으로 합류.",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        },
        "flow": {
          "type": "goto",
          "targetLineId": "scene-6-1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-1",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부 가족은 놀부의 곡식을 빌리지 않기로 했다.\n\n흥부는 다음 날부터 더 많은 일을 찾아다녔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-2",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "새벽에는 장작을 날랐고, 낮에는 남의 밭에서 일했다.\n\n장날이면 먼 길까지 짐을 지고 갔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-3",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "곡식은 조금씩 생겼다.\n\n대신 흥부가 집에 있는 시간은 줄어들었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-4",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "흥부 아내",
        "text": "“오늘 막내가 하루 종일 아버지를 기다렸어요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-5",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“조금만 더 버티면 돼.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-6",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "흥부 아내",
        "text": "“누가요?”\n\n“당신 혼자요, 아니면 우리 가족이요?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-pleading"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-7",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 대답하지 못했다.\n\n가족을 책임지려다가 오히려 가족과 함께할 시간을 모두 잃고 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-8",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "어느 날 흥부는 품삯으로 받은 곡식을 들고 돌아오다가 형편이 어려운 이웃을 만났다.\n\n며칠 전 내린 비에 지붕이 상해, 집 안으로 물이 샌다는 이웃이었다.\n\n흥부의 손이 곡식 자루로 향했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.neighbor",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.neighbor"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-9",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그러다 멈췄다.\n\n집에서 기다리는 가족이 떠올랐다.\n\n그렇다고 어려움을 알고도 그냥 지나치고 싶지는 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.neighbor",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.neighbor"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-10",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“집 지붕이 많이 샌다고 들었어요.”\n\n“내일 일이 끝나면 제가 고쳐 드릴게요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.neighbor",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.neighbor"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-11",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "며칠 뒤, 이웃은 흥부에게 곡식 한 말을 가져왔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.neighbor",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.neighbor"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-12",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“이건 안 주셔도 돼요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.neighbor",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.neighbor"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-13",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "이웃",
        "text": "“자네가 나를 도왔으니 나도 자네를 돕는 거지.”\n\n“도움이 꼭 한쪽으로만 가야 하나?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.neighbor",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.neighbor"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-14",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그 뒤 흥부는 밭일을 도와주고 씨앗을 받았다.\n\n아내는 바느질을 해 주고 필요한 물건을 얻었다.\n\n아이들도 장작을 모으며 자기 몫을 보탰다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-15",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 15,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "몇 번은 놀부에게 곡식을 빌릴 걸 그랬나 후회하기도 했다.\n\n그래도 가족과 이웃은 서로 가진 것을 조금씩 보태며 겨울을 넘겼다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-16",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 16,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 예전보다 조금 다른 사람이 되어 있었다.\n\n남을 돕는 방법이 꼭 가진 것을 내주는 것만은 아니었고, 자기 힘으로 산다는 것이 누구의 도움도 받지 않는다는 뜻도 아니었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-5b-17",
        "chapterId": "chapter-5b",
        "order": 17,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "무엇보다 가족의 어려움을 혼자 짊어지는 대신, 함께 의논하고 서로 가진 것을 주고받는 법을 조금씩 배워 가고 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "B 갈래 종료 후 공통 제비 장면으로 합류.",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ]
        },
        "flow": {
          "type": "goto",
          "targetLineId": "scene-6-1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-6-1",
        "chapterId": "chapter-6",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그해 봄이 무르익어 갈 무렵이었다.\n\n흥부네 처마 아래에 제비 한 쌍이 둥지를 틀었다.\n\n아이들은 아침마다 제비를 올려다보았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "audio": {
          "sounds": [
            {
              "id": "direction:scene-6-1:audio:sound:sfx-swallow",
              "assetId": "audio:sound:sfx-swallow",
              "volume": 0.5
            }
          ]
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-6-2",
        "chapterId": "chapter-6",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "아이",
        "text": "“아버지! 여기 와 봐요!”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "L2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-6-3",
        "chapterId": "chapter-6",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "새끼 제비 한 마리가 둥지 아래로 떨어져 있었다.\n\n작은 다리를 다쳐 제대로 움직이지 못했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-6-4",
        "chapterId": "chapter-6",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“살릴 수 있는지 한번 해 보자.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-swallow-care",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-swallow-care"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-6-5",
        "chapterId": "chapter-6",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 곧장 집 안으로 뛰어들어가려다가 멈췄다.\n\n그리고 아내를 돌아보았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-swallow-care",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-swallow-care"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-6-6",
        "chapterId": "chapter-6",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“여보, 남은 헝겊 조금 써도 될까?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-6-7",
        "chapterId": "chapter-6",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "흥부 아내",
        "text": "“이제 그런 것도 물어봐요?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-6-8",
        "chapterId": "chapter-6",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“물어보라며.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-6-9",
        "chapterId": "chapter-6",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "아이들이 웃었다.\n\n첫째는 가느다란 나뭇가지를 찾았고, 둘째는 헝겊을 가져왔다.\n\n막내는 자기 몸통만 한 장작을 들고 왔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "audio": {
          "sounds": [
            {
              "id": "direction:scene-6-9:audio:sound:sfx-cloth",
              "assetId": "audio:sound:sfx-cloth",
              "volume": 0.5
            }
          ]
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "R2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-6-10",
        "chapterId": "chapter-6",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“그건 제비보다 크잖아.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "R2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-6-11",
        "chapterId": "chapter-6",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "가족은 함께 작은 부목을 만들고 며칠 동안 제비를 돌보았다.\n\n흥부는 가족의 끼니를 줄이거나 꼭 필요한 것을 포기하지 않았다.\n\n있는 것으로 할 수 있는 만큼 도왔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-swallow-care",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-swallow-care"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-6-12",
        "chapterId": "chapter-6",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "얼마 뒤 제비는 다시 하늘로 날아올랐다.\n\n아이들은 처마 밑에서 손을 흔들었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "audio": {
          "sounds": [
            {
              "id": "direction:scene-6-12:audio:sound:sfx-swallow",
              "assetId": "audio:sound:sfx-swallow",
              "volume": 0.5
            }
          ]
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-6-13",
        "chapterId": "chapter-6",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "흥부 아내",
        "text": "“당신은 결국 그대로네요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-6-14",
        "chapterId": "chapter-6",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“그래?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-6-15",
        "chapterId": "chapter-6",
        "order": 15,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 웃었다.\n\n어려운 것을 지나치지 못하는 마음은 그대로였다.\n\n다만 이제는 혼자 마음먹고 모든 것을 내놓는 대신, 가족과 함께 감당할 수 있는 방법을 찾고 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-1",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "다음 해 봄, 제비가 다시 찾아왔다.\n\n부리에는 작은 박씨 하나가 물려 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.heungbu-swallow-eaves",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "audio": {
          "sounds": [
            {
              "id": "direction:scene-7-1:audio:sound:sfx-swallow",
              "assetId": "audio:sound:sfx-swallow",
              "volume": 0.5
            }
          ]
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-2",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "아이들",
        "text": "“작년에 그 제비다!”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.heungbu-swallow-eaves",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "L2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-3",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부 가족은 박씨를 심었다.\n\n박 넝쿨은 지붕을 타고 빠르게 자랐고, 가을에는 커다란 박이 주렁주렁 열렸다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.heungbu-swallow-eaves",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-4",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부가 첫 번째 박에 톱을 댔다.\n\n쓱싹, 쓱싹.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-gourd-saw",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "audio": {
          "sounds": [
            {
              "id": "direction:scene-7-4:audio:sound:sfx-gourd",
              "assetId": "audio:sound:sfx-gourd",
              "volume": 0.5
            }
          ]
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-gourd-saw"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "R2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-5",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "막내",
        "text": "“아버지, 빨리요!”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-gourd-saw",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-gourd-saw"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "R2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R2"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-6",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "쩍!\n\n박이 갈라지자 곡식과 비단, 값진 물건이 우르르 쏟아졌다.\n\n아이들은 마당을 뛰어다녔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.scene.gourd-treasure-burst",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "audio": {
          "sounds": [
            {
              "id": "direction:scene-7-6:audio:sound:sfx-crack",
              "assetId": "audio:sound:sfx-crack",
              "volume": 0.5
            }
          ]
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-7",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“세상에…….”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.scene.gourd-treasure-burst",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-8",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "두 번째 박에서도 재물이 쏟아졌다.\n\n흥부는 한참 동안 말이 없었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.scene.gourd-treasure-burst",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-9",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“어려운 사람들에게 나눠 주면—”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-sharing",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-sharing"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-10",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 말을 멈추고 가족을 바라보았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-sharing",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-sharing"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-11",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“……우선 우리끼리 의논할까?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-12",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그날 밤 가족은 박에서 나온 재물을 가운데 두고 오래 이야기했다.\n\n먼저 낡은 집을 고치고, 다음 농사를 준비하고, 아이들을 위한 몫을 남기기로 했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "audio": {
          "music": {
            "action": "play",
            "assetId": "audio:music:score-warmth",
            "loop": true,
            "volume": 0.32,
            "fadeInMs": 700,
            "fadeOutMs": 500
          }
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-13",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그리고 흥부는 그 힘들었던 겨울 자신에게 손을 내밀어 준 사람들을 먼저 찾아갔다.\n\n빌린 것이 있으면 갚았고, 품과 물건을 주고받았던 사람에게는 고마움을 돌려주었다.\n\n어떤 겨울을 보냈든, 자신이 혼자 힘으로 여기까지 온 것은 아니라는 사실은 같았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-14",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“제비를 도운 건 이것 받으려고 한 일이 아니잖아.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-15",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 15,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "흥부 아내",
        "text": "“그러니까 더 잘 써야겠네요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-16",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 16,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그 뒤 흥부는 이웃을 도왔다.\n\n씨앗이 없는 집에는 다음 농사를 시작할 씨앗을 마련해 주었고, 여러 집이 함께 사용할 농기구도 샀다.\n\n당장 먹을 것이 없는 집에는 곡식을 나누었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-17",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 17,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "누군가 찾아올 때마다 돈부터 꺼내는 일은 줄었다.\n\n흥부는 먼저 사정을 듣고 무엇이 가장 필요한지 함께 생각했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-7-18",
        "chapterId": "chapter-7",
        "order": 18,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부가 덜 따뜻해진 것은 아니었다.\n\n전보다 오래, 그리고 함께 베풀 수 있는 사람이 되어 가고 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-8-1",
        "chapterId": "chapter-8",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부가 부자가 되었다는 소식은 곧 놀부에게도 전해졌다.\n\n놀부는 직접 흥부의 집을 찾아갔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-swallow-eaves",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-8-2",
        "chapterId": "chapter-8",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "낡았던 집은 고쳐져 있었고, 아이들은 배불리 먹고 뛰어놀았다.\n\n그런데 놀부의 눈에 더 이상한 것이 보였다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-swallow-eaves",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-8-3",
        "chapterId": "chapter-8",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 재산을 아무렇게나 쓰고 있지 않았다.\n\n살림을 챙기면서도 사람들을 돕고 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-swallow-eaves",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-8-4",
        "chapterId": "chapter-8",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부 아내",
        "text": "“도련님이 많이 달라졌네요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-8-5",
        "chapterId": "chapter-8",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“뭐가 달라?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-8-6",
        "chapterId": "chapter-8",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부 아내",
        "text": "“예전처럼 무작정 나눠 주는 것 같지는 않아서요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-8-7",
        "chapterId": "chapter-8",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부는 대답하지 않았다.\n\n흥부는 늘 자신이 돌봐 줘야 하는 철없는 동생이라고 생각해 왔다.\n\n그 생각이 흔들리는 것이 싫었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-8-8",
        "chapterId": "chapter-8",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“박이 없었으면 저렇게 됐겠어?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-8-9",
        "chapterId": "chapter-8",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부 아내",
        "text": "“무슨 말이에요?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-8-10",
        "chapterId": "chapter-8",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“결국 운이 좋았던 거야.”\n\n“다친 제비 하나 치료하고 박씨를 받은 거잖아.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-8-11",
        "chapterId": "chapter-8",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그날부터 놀부는 자기 집 처마의 제비들을 유심히 바라보기 시작했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-9-1",
        "chapterId": "chapter-9",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부는 며칠 동안 기다렸다.\n\n하지만 다친 제비는 나타나지 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-9-2",
        "chapterId": "chapter-9",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“흥부한테는 잘도 생기더니.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-9-3",
        "chapterId": "chapter-9",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "문득 한 생각이 떠올랐다.\n\n‘조금 다치기만 하면 내가 바로 고쳐 주면 되잖아.’\n\n놀부는 스스로 놀라 고개를 저었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-9-4",
        "chapterId": "chapter-9",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“내가 무슨 생각을 하는 거야.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-9-5",
        "chapterId": "chapter-9",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "다음 날에도, 그다음 날에도 아무 일은 일어나지 않았다.\n\n생각은 사라지지 않고 조금씩 모양을 바꾸었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-9-6",
        "chapterId": "chapter-9",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부는 둥지 근처에 장애물을 하나 놓아 보았다.\n\n제비 한 마리가 부딪힐 뻔하자 놀라서 곧 치워 버렸다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-9-7",
        "chapterId": "chapter-9",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“이건 아니지.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-9-8",
        "chapterId": "chapter-9",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그런데도 흥부의 박이 자꾸 떠올랐다.\n\n마침내 놀부는 제비 한 마리를 손에 잡았다.\n\n작은 몸이 손 안에서 떨렸다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-swallow-holding",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-swallow-holding"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-9-9",
        "chapterId": "chapter-9",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부의 손이 멈췄다.\n\n아직 돌아갈 수 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-swallow-holding",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-swallow-holding"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-9-10",
        "chapterId": "chapter-9",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“금방 고쳐 줄 거야.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-swallow-holding",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-swallow-holding"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-9-11",
        "chapterId": "chapter-9",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부는 결국 제비의 다리를 다치게 했다.\n\n그리고 자신이 다치게 한 다리를 정성껏 치료했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-swallow-holding",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-swallow-holding"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-9-12",
        "chapterId": "chapter-9",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“이제 흥부하고 똑같이 한 거야.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-9-13",
        "chapterId": "chapter-9",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "하지만 그 말을 하는 놀부의 얼굴에는 웃음이 없었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.swallow",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.swallow"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-1",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "다음 해, 정말로 제비가 박씨를 물어왔다.\n\n놀부는 뛸 듯이 기뻐했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "audio": {
          "sounds": [
            {
              "id": "direction:scene-10-1:audio:sound:sfx-swallow",
              "assetId": "audio:sound:sfx-swallow",
              "volume": 0.5
            }
          ]
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-2",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“거봐! 흥부만 되는 일이 아니라니까!”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-3",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "커다란 박들이 열렸다.\n\n놀부는 가족과 동네 사람들을 불러 모으고 첫 번째 박을 탔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "audio": {
          "sounds": [
            {
              "id": "direction:scene-10-3:audio:sound:sfx-gourd",
              "assetId": "audio:sound:sfx-gourd",
              "volume": 0.5
            }
          ]
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-4",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "쩍!\n\n금은보화 대신 깨진 항아리와 낡은 솥, 오래된 짚단이 우르르 쏟아졌다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.scene.nolbu-broken-goods",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-5",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“뭐야, 이게!”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.scene.nolbu-broken-goods",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-6",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "아이들",
        "text": "“아버지, 박에서 쓰레기가 나와요!”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-03",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.scene.nolbu-broken-goods",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-03",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-03"
            },
            {
              "key": "L2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-04",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-04"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-7",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부 아내",
        "text": "“이제 그만해요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-03",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.scene.nolbu-broken-goods",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-03",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-03"
            },
            {
              "key": "L2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-04",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-04"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-8",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“첫 번째가 잘못된 거야.”\n\n“다음 박이 진짜겠지.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.scene.nolbu-broken-goods",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-9",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "두 번째 박이 갈라지자 이번에는 도깨비들이 튀어나왔다.\n\n도깨비들은 마당을 뛰어다니며 장독 뚜껑을 뒤집고, 곡식 자루를 굴리고, 놀부의 갓을 빼앗아 달아났다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.scene.nolbu-goblin-chaos",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "audio": {
          "sounds": [
            {
              "id": "direction:scene-10-9:audio:sound:sfx-crack",
              "assetId": "audio:sound:sfx-crack",
              "volume": 0.5
            }
          ]
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked"
            }
          ]
        },
        "presentation": {
          "effects": [
            {
              "id": "direction:scene-10-9:shake",
              "intensity": "soft",
              "repeat": "once",
              "scope": "cut",
              "target": {
                "kind": "background"
              },
              "trigger": "scene-enter",
              "type": "shake"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-10",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“내 갓! 거기 서!”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.scene.nolbu-goblin-chaos",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-11",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "간신히 도깨비들을 쫓아냈을 때 마당은 엉망이 되어 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.scene.nolbu-broken-goods",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-12",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부 아내",
        "text": "“정말 그만해요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.scene.nolbu-broken-goods",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-13",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부도 잠시 남은 박들을 바라보았다.\n\n지금 멈추면 이미 잃은 것만 남는다.\n\n하지만 다음 박에서 재물이 나오면 모두 되찾을 수 있을 것 같았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.scene.nolbu-broken-goods",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-14",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“하나만 더.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.scene.nolbu-broken-goods",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-angry"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-15",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 15,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "하나가 둘이 되고 둘이 셋이 되었다.\n\n마지막 박이 갈라지자 거센 물과 바람이 쏟아져 나왔다.\n\n곡식은 젖고 집 한쪽이 무너졌다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.scene.nolbu-storm-collapse",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "audio": {
          "sounds": [
            {
              "id": "direction:scene-10-15:audio:sound:sfx-water",
              "assetId": "audio:sound:sfx-water",
              "volume": 0.5
            }
          ]
        },
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked"
            }
          ]
        },
        "presentation": {
          "effects": [
            {
              "id": "direction:scene-10-15:shake",
              "intensity": "soft",
              "repeat": "once",
              "scope": "cut",
              "target": {
                "kind": "background"
              },
              "trigger": "scene-enter",
              "type": "shake"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-16",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 16,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부는 엉망이 된 마당 한가운데 주저앉았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-17",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 17,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“왜 흥부하고 다른 거야…….”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-18",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 18,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "처음에는 박씨를 탓했다.\n\n다음에는 제비를 탓했다.\n\n그러다 흥부가 뭔가 숨겼을 거라고도 생각했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu-shocked"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-10-19",
        "chapterId": "chapter-10",
        "order": 19,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "하지만 혼자 있을 때마다 한 장면이 떠올랐다.\n\n자기 손 안에서 떨던 작은 제비였다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated",
        "rightAssetId": "",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": []
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-1",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부네가 어려워졌다는 소식은 흥부에게도 전해졌다.\n\n집 한쪽이 무너졌고 곡식도 많이 잃었다.\n\n겨울도 멀지 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-2",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부가 직접 찾아가 보니 처마 한쪽에는 임시로 짚과 천을 얹어 놓았고, 마당에는 젖은 이불이 널려 있었다.\n\n놀부의 아이 하나가 바람을 피해 어머니 곁에 바짝 붙어 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-3",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "집으로 돌아온 흥부가 입을 열었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-4",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“우리 집으로 모셔 오면—”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-5",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 말을 하다가 스스로 멈췄다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-6",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“또 내가 혼자 정할 뻔했네.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-7",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그날 저녁 흥부 가족은 모두 한자리에 모였다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "L2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-8",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "첫째",
        "text": "“큰아버지네가 추우면 우리 집에 오면 되잖아요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "L2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-9",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "둘째",
        "text": "“그런데 큰아버지가 아버지한테 못되게 한 적도 있잖아요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "L2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L2"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-10",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "흥부 아내",
        "text": "“솔직히 말하면 나도 바로 같이 살자고 하기는 어렵네요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "L2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-11",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "흥부 아내",
        "text": "“그래도 형님이 잘못했다고 형님네 아이들까지 추운 집에서 살아야 하는 건 아니고요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-01",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-01"
            },
            {
              "key": "L2",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.child-02",
              "characterKey": "heungbu.child-02"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu-worried"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-12",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 자신이 힘들었던 겨울을 떠올렸다.\n\n도움을 받는 일은 고맙기만 한 것도, 불편하기만 한 것도 아니었다.\n\n누군가의 손이 있어 겨울을 넘길 수 있었고, 때로는 그 손이 자신의 삶을 어디까지 건드려도 되는지 고민하기도 했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-13",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "가족은 두 가지 방법을 놓고 의논했다.\n\n한동안 두 가족이 함께 지내며 겨울을 넘기고 다시 설 준비를 할 수도 있었다.\n\n빈집을 서둘러 고쳐 놀부 가족이 처음부터 자기 살림을 다시 꾸리도록 도울 수도 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-heungbu"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-14",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "다음 날 흥부는 다시 놀부를 찾아갔다.\n\n오래전 흥부가 놀부 집 문 앞에 서 있던 때와 자리가 뒤바뀌어 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-15",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 15,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“구경 왔냐?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-16",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 16,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“아니.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-17",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 17,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“그럼 돈 주러 왔어?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-18",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 18,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“형이 앞으로 어떻게 살고 싶은지 물으러 왔어.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-19",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 19,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부가 처음으로 흥부를 똑바로 바라보았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-20",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 20,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“내가 고를 처지냐?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-21",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 21,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“형이 살 일이잖아.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-22",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 22,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“아이들 생각하면 당장 지낼 지붕은 필요하다.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-ruined-seated"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-23",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 23,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“그런데 다시 네 집에 들어가는 게 맞는지…… 나도 모르겠다.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-24",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 24,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부는 도움을 받아야 한다는 사실도, 동생에게 기대야 할지도 모른다는 사실도 모두 불편해 보였다.\n\n하지만 아이들을 돌아보자 더는 고집만 부릴 수도 없었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-25",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 25,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“우리도 두 가지를 생각해 봤어.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-26",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 26,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“겨울 동안 우리 집에서 함께 지내며 준비할 수도 있고,”\n\n“빈집을 같이 고쳐서 형네가 처음부터 따로 시작하도록 도울 수도 있어.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-27",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 27,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "어느 쪽도 쉬운 길은 아니었다.\n\n함께 지내면 당장의 추위와 생활 걱정은 덜 수 있었지만, 예전의 갈등이 매일의 생활 속에서 다시 나타날 수 있었다.\n\n따로 시작하면 서로의 경계를 지킬 수 있었지만, 무너진 살림을 다시 세우는 첫겨울은 더 고되고 외로울 수 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-11-28",
        "chapterId": "chapter-11",
        "order": 28,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부 가족은 어떤 방법으로 놀부 가족을 도울까?",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.nolbu-ruined-yard",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "최종 핵심 선택. A=공동체형 관계, B=독립형 관계. 우열 금지.",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ]
        },
        "flow": {
          "type": "choice",
          "options": [
            {
              "id": "choice-ending-together",
              "label": "겨울 동안 두 가족이 함께 지낸다",
              "targetLineId": "scene-12a-1"
            },
            {
              "id": "choice-ending-separate",
              "label": "놀부 가족이 따로 다시 시작하도록 돕는다",
              "targetLineId": "scene-12b-1"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-1",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부 가족은 겨울 동안 흥부네 집에서 함께 지내기로 했다.\n\n놀부는 쉽게 고개를 끄덕이지 못했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-2",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“내가 네 집에 얹혀살게 될 줄은 몰랐다.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-3",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“평생 있으라는 게 아니야.”\n\n“겨울 지나고 다시 시작할 때까지만 같이 해 보자.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-4",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부 아내",
        "text": "“일단 아이들부터 따뜻하게 재워요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-5",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "함께 사는 일은 예상대로 쉽지만은 않았다.\n\n며칠 지나지 않아 놀부는 흥부의 살림을 보면 자꾸 입이 근질거렸다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-6",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“저 집에 또 곡식 보낼 거냐?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-7",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“응. 씨앗이 하나도 없대.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-8",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“그러다가 또—”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-9",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부가 말을 멈췄다.\n\n흥부도 바로 화를 내지 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-thinking"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-10",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“우리 겨울 몫은 남겨 뒀어.”\n\n“가족하고도 이야기했고.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-11",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“……얼마나 남겼는데?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-12",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“장부 볼래?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-13",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부는 장부를 한참 살펴보다 다시 돌려주었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-14",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“이 정도면…… 됐다.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-15",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 15,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "며칠 뒤에는 반대 일이 생겼다.\n\n흥부가 새 농기구를 사겠다고 하자 놀부가 계산을 해 보더니 고개를 저었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-16",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 16,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“지금 사면 겨울 끝날 때 돈이 부족해.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-17",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 17,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“또 잔소리하려고?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-18",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 18,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 투덜거리면서도 계산을 다시 해 보았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-19",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 19,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“……이번에는 형 말이 맞네.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-20",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 20,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“이번에는?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-21",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 21,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "둘은 잠시 노려보다 함께 웃었다.\n\n물론 늘 이렇게 끝나는 것은 아니었다.\n\n과거 이야기가 나오면 목소리가 커지는 날도 있었고, 두 집 살림 방식이 달라 불편한 날도 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-22",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 22,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그래도 이번에는 누구도 화가 난다고 곧바로 “나가라”거나 “다 필요 없다”고 말하지 않았다.\n\n불편한 날도 다음 날 다시 밥상에서 마주 앉았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-23",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 23,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "봄이 되자 놀부 가족은 다시 자기 살림을 준비하기 시작했다.\n\n그때 흥부가 마을 끝의 작은 밭을 가리켰다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-24",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 24,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“형. 저 밭은 같이 해 볼래?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-25",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 25,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“왜 나랑?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-26",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 26,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“형은 계획 세우는 건 잘하고, 나는 사람들과 일손 나누는 건 잘하잖아.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-27",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 27,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“스스로 칭찬도 잘하고.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-28",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 28,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "두 형제는 작은 밭 하나를 함께 경작하기 시작했다.\n\n놀부는 씨앗과 수확량을 계산했고, 흥부는 이웃들과 품을 나누었다.\n\n두 가족은 다시 각자의 살림 공간을 마련했지만 그 밭만큼은 공동으로 두었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-29",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 29,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "가을.\n\n공동 창고에 곡식이 차곡차곡 쌓였다.\n\n흥부가 곡식 한 자루를 어깨에 메었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-30",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 30,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“그건 어디 가져가?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-31",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 31,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 기다렸다는 듯 장부를 펼쳐 보였다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-32",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 32,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“우리 두 집 겨울 몫이랑 내년 씨앗까지 계산했어.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-sharing",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-sharing"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-33",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 33,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“제법인데.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-sharing",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-sharing"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-34",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 34,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부는 잠시 장부와 곡식 자루를 번갈아 보았다.\n\n그러더니 창고에서 작은 자루 하나를 더 꺼냈다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-sharing",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-sharing"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-35",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 35,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“그건 왜?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-36",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 36,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“김 서방네 아이가 아프다더라.”\n\n“이 정도는 더 줘도 내년 농사에 문제없어.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-37",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 37,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "이번에는 흥부가 놀부를 가만히 바라보았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-38",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 38,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“왜?”\n\n“나도 반은 줄 줄 안다.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12a-39",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12a",
        "order": 39,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부가 웃음을 터뜨렸다.\n\n멀리서 아이들도 따라 웃었다.\n\n마지막 햇살 아래, 두 형제는 여전히 서로 다른 사람이었지만 같은 밭에서 각자의 몫을 하고 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "명시적 엔딩. 다음 장으로 자동 진행하지 않음.",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing"
            }
          ]
        },
        "flow": {
          "type": "goto",
          "targetLineId": null
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-1",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 1,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부 가족은 마을에 오래 비어 있던 작은 집을 놀부 가족이 지낼 수 있도록 서둘러 고치기로 했다.\n\n날이 더 추워지기 전에 해야 할 일이 많았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.poor-house-winter",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-2",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 2,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“네 집으로 오라는 말은 안 하는구나.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.poor-house-winter",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-3",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 3,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“형이 우리 집에서 지내고 싶다고 하면 그것도 다시 이야기할 수 있어.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.poor-house-winter",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-4",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 4,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“하지만 형이 처음부터 자기 살림을 다시 해 보고 싶다면 그 방법도 같이 만들고 싶어.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.poor-house-winter",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-5",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 5,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "놀부는 한참 동안 대답하지 않았다.\n\n그러다 무너진 자기 집과 아이들을 번갈아 보았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.poor-house-winter",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-6",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 6,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“……따로 시작해 보겠다.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.poor-house-winter",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-7",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 7,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“그럼 집부터 같이 고치자.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.poor-house-winter",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-8",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 8,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "두 가족은 함께 빈집의 지붕을 고쳤다.\n\n흥부는 첫 농사를 위한 씨앗과 꼭 필요한 농기구를 마련해 주었다.\n\n며칠 동안 먹을 곡식도 채워 두었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.poor-house-winter",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-9",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 9,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "하지만 어느 밭을 빌리고 무엇을 심을지, 살림을 어떻게 꾸릴지는 놀부 가족이 직접 정했다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.poor-house-winter",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-10",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 10,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "첫겨울과 첫 농사는 쉽지 않았다.\n\n밤에는 바람이 문틈으로 들어왔고, 예상보다 돈이 더 드는 날도 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.poor-house-winter",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-11",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 11,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "어느 날 큰비까지 내려 놀부 밭 일부에 물이 찼다.\n\n놀부는 물에 잠긴 밭을 한참 바라보았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.poor-house-winter",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-12",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 12,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부 아내",
        "text": "“도움을 청하는 게 그렇게 어려워요?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.poor-house-winter",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-13",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 13,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“동생한테 또 손 벌리는 것 같잖아.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.poor-house-winter",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-14",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 14,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부 아내",
        "text": "“같이 해 달라고 말하는 것하고 대신 해 달라는 건 다르잖아요.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.poor-house-winter",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-remorse"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.wife-nolbu"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-15",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 15,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "다음 날 아침.\n\n놀부는 흥부 집 문 앞에 서 있었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-16",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 16,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“형? 웬일이야?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-17",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 17,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“……내일 시간 있냐?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-18",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 18,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“왜?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-19",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 19,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“밭에 물이 찼다.”\n\n“혼자 하기는 좀 많아서.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-20",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 20,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 웃거나 놀리지 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-21",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 21,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“아침에 갈게.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-thinking"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-22",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 22,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "다음 날 두 형제는 함께 물길을 팠다.\n\n놀부도 흥부가 바쁜 철이면 먼저 찾아가 일손을 보탰다.\n\n그러나 일이 끝나면 각자 자기 집으로 돌아갔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.spring-field",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-23",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 23,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "몇 해가 지났다.\n\n놀부는 다시 자기 밭에서 제대로 된 첫 수확을 거두었다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.two-houses-path",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-working"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-working"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-24",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 24,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "그날 저녁 놀부가 곡식 한 자루와 작은 떡 꾸러미를 들고 흥부 집을 찾아왔다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.two-houses-path",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-25",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 25,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“갚으러 왔어?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.two-houses-path",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-26",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 26,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“아니다.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.two-houses-path",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-default"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-27",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 27,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "left",
        "speakerName": "흥부",
        "text": "“그럼?”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.two-houses-path",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "L1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-28",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 28,
        "type": "dialogue",
        "speaker": "right",
        "speakerName": "놀부",
        "text": "“같이 먹자고.”",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.two-houses-path",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing"
            }
          ],
          "speakerActorKey": "R1"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-29",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 29,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부가 문을 활짝 열었다.\n\n두 가족은 오랜만에 한 상에 둘러앉았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-30",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 30,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "식사가 거의 끝날 무렵, 상 위에는 떡 하나가 남았다.\n\n놀부는 아무 말 없이 떡을 반으로 갈라 한쪽을 흥부 앞에 놓았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing",
        "backgroundId": "heungbu.background.family-dinner-night",
        "purposeNote": "",
        "emotionNote": "",
        "directionNote": "",
        "stageComposition": {
          "leftActors": [
            {
              "key": "L1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy"
            }
          ],
          "rightActors": [
            {
              "key": "R1",
              "assetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "scene-12b-31",
        "chapterId": "chapter-12b",
        "order": 31,
        "type": "narration",
        "speaker": "narration",
        "speakerName": "해설",
        "text": "흥부는 그 떡을 잠시 바라보다가 웃었다.\n\n놀부도 따라 웃었지만, 둘 다 옛날 이야기를 꺼내지는 않았다.",
        "leftAssetId": "heungbu.character.heungbu-happy",
        "rightAssetId": "heungbu.character.nolbu-sharing",
